ind":"announcement","title":"Development Newsletter: Steam Next Fest & Hermit Demo","summary":"Hello, all!I'm back after a long break during the months of August/September with some more game updates! While a number of major changes were shipped for the demo during August and September, there were no newsletters posted while I've been away. As a result, some important updates from all three months are included here.Steam Next Fest, Demo Finalization, and the main gameOver the past year I have worked somewhat tirelessly on updating the Hermit Demo. This has been helpful for me as a develop","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T13:55:25Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706690331","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:52:22Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3787470-1846018067941964","game_id":"steam-3787470","kind":"update","title":"Demo Patch Notes for 2026-10-12","summary":"Shipped new 2D and 3D art assets for the Nemin Wanders / Nemin caravan","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-12T18:26:45Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067941964","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:52:22Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3787470-1846018067936899","game_id":"steam-3787470","kind":"update","title":"Demo Patch Notes for 2026-10-10","summary":"Quest objectives requiring items to be obtained will now also search the player's satchel for that item, not just the backpack and quest inventoryShipped a fix for an issue related to dying while having a menu open causing the game to become stuckShipped a fix for the main questline objective 'unlock the power of fire magic' not detecting all types of unlockable fire spellsShipped a fix for a potential bug where if the player died and respawned close to an NPC that triggers dialogue, the dialogu","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-10T17:54:50Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067936899","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:52:22Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3787470-1846018067934726","game_id":"steam-3787470","kind":"update","title":"Demo Patch Notes for 2026-10-09","summary":"Fixed an issue that could sometimes cause food to persist forever in inventory when dropped, picked up, and immediately consumed","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-09T21:34:40Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067934726","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:52:22Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3787470-1846018067924717","game_id":"steam-3787470","kind":"update","title":"Demo Patch Notes for 2026-10-06","summary":"Added a new HUD element for tracking the currently active questThe new quest-tracker HUD UI can also be disabled from the game settings menu for players that prefer the HUD look without it","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-07T01:31:09Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067924717","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:52:22Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3787470-1845383656391996","game_id":"steam-3787470","kind":"update","title":"Demo Patch Notes for 2026-10-04","summary":"Fixed an issue with dungeon bear traps not persisting","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-04T20:27:21Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656391996","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:52:22Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3787470-1844115010504937","game_id":"steam-3787470","kind":"update","title":"Demo Patch Notes for 2026-09-22b","summary":"Fixed an issue with worm enemies despawning randomly","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-22T17:05:13Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844115010504937","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:52:22Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3787470-1844115010504536","game_id":"steam-3787470","kind":"update","title":"Demo Patch Notes for 2026-09-22","summary":"Pushed some small Halloween event changes to the demo beta installsHalloween changes, once completed, will be pushed to all players on October 1st","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-22T15:17:15Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844115010504536","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:52:22Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3787470-1843481262704718","game_id":"steam-3787470","kind":"update","title":"Demo Patch Notes for 2026-09-15","summary":"Disabled some of the new landscape grass meshes temporarily for performance debugging","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-15T14:19:22Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262704718","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:52:22Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3787470-1843481262700046","game_id":"steam-3787470","kind":"update","title":"Demo Patch Notes for 2026-09-13","summary":"Fixed some lighting issues that could cause flickering during the transition from night to dayFixed some issues with skylight exposure; skies will now appear more blue/saturated during the dayImplemented a new procedural landscape grass type that should allow for denser grass without causing significant performance costsFixed/cleaned up some streamed level actors in a few placesThe game now defaults to 07:00 on new playthroughs so that new players should typically have full daylight by the time ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-13T19:12:06Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262700046","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:52:22Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3787470-1842212951304886","game_id":"steam-3787470","kind":"update","title":"Demo Patch Notes for 2026-08-28","summary":"Significantly improved the look of curb splines with new custom curb meshesFixed an issue with the new ice and fire boss abilities","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-29T03:50:48Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842212951304886","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:52:22Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3787470-1842212951300422","game_id":"steam-3787470","kind":"update","title":"Demo Patch Notes for 2026-08-27","summary":"The following changes will be rolled out slowly on Beta branches first, with general roll out for all players coming later:Added new boss magic abilities to the ancient fire mageAdded new boss magic abilities to the ice captainImproved loading when exiting the tutorial dungeon to prevent asset pop-in in this area","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-27T15:30:43Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842212951300422","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:52:22Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3787470-1841579228670164","game_id":"steam-3787470","kind":"update","title":"Demo Patch Notes for 2026-08-21","summary":"Started work on a new quest / assets for upcoming September/October game festivalsCreated new 3D assets for streetlampsImproved the Parallax Occlusion Mapping on cobblestone and mud for the landscape; cobblestones now appears to proper depth","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-21T21:54:00Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1841579228670164","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:52:22Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3787470-1840944183787127","game_id":"steam-3787470","kind":"update","title":"Demo Patch Notes for 2026-08-17b","summary":"The following changes will be shipped to all demo install versions later this afternoon:Added new character creation parametersPlayers can now customize skin tone, hair darkness, hair redness, and eye color when making a new characterThe character creation camera now zooms in on the player character's portrait when editing hair/eyes, making the changes easier to seeFixed an issue with 1H animation blendspaces not playing footstep sounds sometimesFixed an issue with Mausoleum memory spawned cache","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-17T19:58:01Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840944183787127","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:52:22Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3787470-1840944183786132","game_id":"steam-3787470","kind":"update","title":"Demo Patch Notes for 2026-08-17","summary":"The following changes will ship later this afternoon to all demo install versions:Added support for vaulting for NPCsHumanoid characters will now vault smoothly over outdoor retaining walls instead of jumping","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-17T14:02:28Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840944183786132","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:52:22Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3787470-1840944183784061","game_id":"steam-3787470","kind":"update","title":"Demo Patch Notes for 2026-08-16","summary":"Finished work on updated catacomb meshesShipped an additional fix for potential 'Fatal Error' the first time the game is ever launched; there is still at least one potential cause for this issue being investigated, but for the moment simply launching the game a second time seems to always resolve the problemFixed a display issue with some catacomb material slots","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-16T15:01:04Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840944183784061","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:52:22Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3787470-1840310314354601","game_id":"steam-3787470","kind":"update","title":"Demo Patch Notes for 2026-08-11","summary":"The donkey will now make more varied braying noises when calledFixed an issue with the bed in the Gravenstaad player house being sometimes unusable","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-11T16:34:39Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840310314354601","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:52:22Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3787470-1840310314352603","game_id":"steam-3787470","kind":"update","title":"Demo Patch Notes for 2026-08-10","summary":"Books now have a more polished appearance, and will display text on the page more neatly as wellRe-created the book widget 2D UI elementsRe-wrot